  "coverage": "19 regions and all 308 municipalities, including autonomous, demilitarised Swedish-speaking Åland and its 16 municipalities. Eurostat GISCO 2024 land geometry reconciled to current 2026 Statistics Finland municipality codes by dissolving Pertunmaa into Mäntyharju, the current official municipality-to-region crosswalk, 2025 year-end population, and National Land Survey 2026 land area. English, Finnish and Swedish names are retained. Åland is part of Finland, not a separate sovereign country or overseas dependency. Parent region geometry is dissolved from the same municipality polygons. Major Natural Earth lake water is removed at all levels.",
